<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills on March 4.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills on March 4.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine will auction three-month, six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount treasury bills on March 4, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of three-month T-bills was set at 8.08 million hryvnias.</p>
<p>The issue volume of six-month T-bills was set at 13.25 million hryvnias, nine-month paper was set at 33.76 million hryvnias, while 41.87 million hryvnias worth of 12-month T-bills will be issued.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
